        "text": "\\begin{lstlisting}[language=Java]\npublic int method2(int n) {\nint sum = 0;\nint i = 0;\nwhile (i < n) {\nint j = 0;\nwhile (j < n) {\nif (j % 2 == 0) {\n// do nothing\n}\nsum = sum + (i * 3) + j;\nj = j + 1;\n}\ni = i + 1;\n} return sum;\n}\n\\end{lstlisting}"
